We can talk ourselves to death about whether or not changes to Gehennom
need to be made, so I'm just going to split this part of the thread so
we can discuss 'what' sort of changes we want made rather than just
whether or not they should be made.

Some ideas that occur to me:

Ice levels - Open cavern with ice demons and other monsters, plus
patches of thin ice.

Hedge maze level. Walls are attackable, attacking/bumping into a wall
may snag items out of your inventory. Walls regenerate back and may
envelope players if they stand in the wrong place.

Draining level. Each action consumes ten times the power and hunger.

Mirror level. Movement keystrokes are inverted.


Thoughts? Ideas?



